<title>USA: PCX to trade options on Sabratek from July 11.</title>
<headline>PCX to trade options on Sabratek from July 11.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pacific Exchange (PCX) said Thursday it will begin trading options on shares of Sabratek Corp on July 11.</p>
<p>The exchange said opening strike prices have been set at 22-1/2, 25 and 30, with initial expirations in August, September, November and February.</p>
<p>Position limits have been set at 4,500 contracts.</p>
<p>The options have been allocated to lead market makers Matthew Zahner, Michael Resch and Martin Resch.</p>
<p>((--Chicago derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
